I am a student and I am writing a research paper. I found this article very helpful. I will make sure to avoid these mistakes. Can you please provide me with some more tips on how to write a good research paper?

Sure, here are some additional tips:

1. Choose a topic that interests you: When you choose a topic that you are passionate about, it will make your research paper more enjoyable to write.

2. Use credible sources: Make sure to use reliable sources for your research paper. This will ensure that your information is accurate and trustworthy.

3. Plan your time wisely: Set a schedule for yourself and stick to it. This will help you avoid procrastination and ensure that you have enough time to complete your research paper.

4. Use proper citation: Proper citation is important to avoid plagiarism. Make sure to cite your sources correctly and consistently throughout your research paper.

5. Revise and edit: Once you have completed your research paper, take the time to revise and edit it. This will help you catch any errors or mistakes and make sure that your paper flows smoothly.

I hope these tips help you write a great research paper! Good luck!</s>